 "parte": 1,
 "titulo": "He promised a king the head of Medusa 🐍 Perseus Part 1 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "ONE LOOK = STONE",
 "descripcion": "Thrown into the sea in a wooden chest as a baby, Perseus grows up to make the most reckless promise in Greek myth: bring a king the head of the Gorgon.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you have made that promise?\n\nFrom Greek myth: Apollodorus, Library 2.4; Ovid, Metamorphoses 4-5; Hesiod, Theogony.\n#perseus #medusa #greekmythology #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "A king locked his own daughter in a *bronze room*, because of a prophecy.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The oracle said: your grandson will kill you.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But Zeus came into the room as a rain of gold, and a boy was born.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "His name was *Perseus*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The king threw mother and baby into the sea, inside a wooden chest.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "They drifted for days, until a fisherman pulled them onto the island of Seriphos.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Perseus grew up strong, and fast with a spear.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Too strong for the island's king, Polydectes.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Because Polydectes wanted his mother, *Danaë*, and Perseus stood in the way.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the king set a trap at a feast.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every guest had to bring the king a gift. A horse, at least.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Perseus owned nothing. So he said something stupid.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Name it, and I'll bring it. Even the *head of the Gorgon*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The king smiled. That was exactly what he wanted.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Medusa. Snakes for hair. One look, and you turn to stone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "No man who went to find her ever came back.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "That night, a goddess in armor appeared with a shield of polished bronze.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Athena said: never look at her. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
